{"id":3972,"date":"2025-05-27T08:08:22","date_gmt":"2025-05-27T08:08:22","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/?p=3972"},"modified":"2025-08-11T04:46:44","modified_gmt":"2025-08-11T04:46:44","slug":"cach-ban-hang-tren-tiktok-shop","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/tin-tuc\/cach-ban-hang-tren-tiktok-shop\/","title":{"rendered":"C\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop t\u0103ng nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow"},"content":{"rendered":"<div data-page-id=\"BAbvdO5oFovP0YxLKwal38MNgQb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tn08disZ5olEhDxEsy4loxq6gCg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"BAbvdO5oFovP0YxLKwal38MNgQb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Tn08disZ5olEhDxEsy4loxq6gCg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">C\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 ? Vi\u1ec7c thu h\u00fat l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem v\u00e0 l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap t\u0103ng doanh thu m\u00e0 c\u00f2n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd. B\u00e0i vi\u1ebft n\u00e0y s\u1ebd b\u1eadt m\u00ed nh\u1eefng b\u00ed quy\u1ebft \u0111\u01a1n gi\u1ea3n nh\u01b0ng c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u00fang kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 lan t\u1ecfa m\u1ea1nh m\u1ebd tr\u00ean n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng TikTok. Xem ngay h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn \u0111\u1ea7y \u0111\u1ee7 b\u00ean d\u01b0\u1edbi c\u00f9ng <a href=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/\"><strong>Lemon<\/strong><\/a> nh\u00e9!<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-WrH6dNqX5odjZgxj8XVlU21Jgze\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>Nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u c\u1ea7n kh\u1eafc ph\u1ee5c \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00eanh TikTok shop c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n tr\u00e1nh b\u1ecb flop, \u00edt t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c.<\/strong><\/h2>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<table class=\"ace-table\" style=\"width: 94.5231%; height: 264px;\" data-ace-table-col-widths=\"316;558\">\n<colgroup>\n<col width=\"316\" \/>\n<col width=\"558\" \/><\/colgroup>\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 40.5888%; height: 24px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-NJDxddnqso5V7IxGsRNlewaUgTf\"><strong>V\u1ea5n \u0110\u1ec1<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; width: 111.444%; height: 24px;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PUUadO6McoGQbPxkCZOlFURLgqh\"><strong>C\u00e1ch Kh\u1eafc Ph\u1ee5c<\/strong><\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 48px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-D8vtdG6pEoL6iyxShhnlC8KRgfb\">1. N\u1ed9i dung nh\u00e0m ch\u00e1n, thi\u1ebfu s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 48px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZCpbdrmTZoHhmXx3BGClA3AcgYH\">\u0110\u1ea7u t\u01b0 v\u00e0o \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng, b\u1ed1i c\u1ea3nh, \u00e2m nh\u1ea1c v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n video. Video c\u1ea7n thu h\u00fat ngay t\u1eeb 3 gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-UaXCd6LVooAyj5xhD0flqDQsgUb\">2. Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u0103ng video th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TTPUdQmVCowST5xu89ilDS6Qgcf\">\u0110\u0103ng \u00edt khi\u1ebfn thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n kh\u00f4ng \u01b0u ti\u00ean k\u00eanh. N\u00ean duy tr\u00ec 1\u20132 video\/ng\u00e0y.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 48px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 48px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AT0Td9DCNoZmGYxEgFDlWRGAgLd\">3. Kh\u00f4ng hi\u1ec3u r\u00f5 kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 48px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WM7jd3A39oHYYYx0kihlts96gPg\">L\u00e0m n\u1ed9i dung lan man, kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u00fang \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u1ebd r\u1ea5t kh\u00f3 viral. C\u1ea7n nghi\u00ean c\u1ee9u insight kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng k\u1ef9 l\u01b0\u1ee1ng.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Xv0YdAS5IoVfujxWVeGlH0kDgEh\">4. \u0110\u0103ng sai th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VcwUdwpLyomy6DxKKKUl2NyUgkg\">\u0110\u0103ng video ngo\u00e0i khung gi\u1edd \u201cv\u00e0ng\u201d khi\u1ebfn ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn th\u1ea5p. N\u00ean \u0111\u0103ng v\u00e0o 11h\u201313h ho\u1eb7c 19h\u201321h.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OoOHd2dAuoNVdHxXzrsl4K9BgGd\">5. Thi\u1ebfu l\u1eddi k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng (CTA)<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Dr61dvRTgoIdWBxIgkslooLugIg\">Kh\u00f4ng h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c mua h\u00e0ng s\u1ebd l\u00e0m gi\u1ea3m hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Llrzdma7NoMk0fxA4zQljvHpgsc\">6. Kh\u00f4ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FOBtdcBs8oNG9kxzs0jlFNAngsd\">Kh\u00f4ng tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn ho\u1eb7c tin nh\u1eafn s\u1ebd khi\u1ebfn kh\u00e1ch r\u1eddi b\u1ecf k\u00eanh.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EMJyderDFovkyYxdnqzlKhALg1b\">7. Thi\u1ebfu s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-QS0bdz6KJo1VdpxBZHNlbV9vgWe\">H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m m\u1edd, kh\u00f4ng r\u00f5 gi\u00e1, thi\u1ebfu m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 g\u00e2y m\u1ea5t thi\u1ec7n c\u1ea3m.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 24px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 40.5888%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JIf7ddtIcozCzWxgGZelPO3xgCe\">8. Vi ph\u1ea1m ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok Shop<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<td style=\"width: 111.444%; height: 24px; text-align: left;\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-MqGedsDKOoA6EkxqCnglsrCMgbc\">Video b\u1ecb h\u1ea1n ch\u1ebf hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb, gi\u1ea3m t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c. Lu\u00f4n ki\u1ec3m tra n\u1ed9i dung k\u1ef9 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi \u0111\u0103ng.<\/div>\n<\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-LTDPd2KEloBQqUxC0WblnFjNgUe\" style=\"text-align: left;\">C\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop \u0111\u1ea1t nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow.<\/h2>\n<\/div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3958\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3958\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3958 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-18.png\" alt=\"C\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok \u0111\u1ea1t nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u01a1t xem, l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow.\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-18.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-18-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-18-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-18-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-18-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3958\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">C\u00e1ch b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok Shop \u0111\u1ea1t nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem, l\u01b0\u1ee3t follow.<\/figcaption><\/figure>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<div data-page-id=\"BAbvdO5oFovP0YxLKwal38MNgQb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-COsLdFia9ogFMAxAlhelmZfSgxb\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>1. S\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, b\u1eaft trend<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XTLGd2P2Ro9CZ2xqWW7lB5YPgZd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Mu\u1ed1n thu h\u00fat l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem v\u00e0 follow tr\u00ean TikTok, vi\u1ec7c s\u1ea3n xu\u1ea5t video ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u00e0 y\u1ebfu t\u1ed1 ti\u00ean quy\u1ebft. H\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh ph\u1ea3i r\u00f5 n\u00e9t, \u00e1nh s\u00e1ng t\u1ed1t, \u00e2m thanh r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung ph\u1ea3i c\u00f3 \u0111i\u1ec3m nh\u1ea5n. \u0110\u1eb7c bi\u1ec7t, n\u00ean c\u1eadp nh\u1eadt v\u00e0 \u00e1p d\u1ee5ng c\u00e1c xu h\u01b0\u1edbng, trend \u0111ang \u201chot\u201d nh\u01b0 nh\u1ea1c n\u1ec1n viral, hi\u1ec7u \u1ee9ng n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt hay c\u00e1c concept n\u1ed9i dung \u0111ang \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c quan t\u00e2m. B\u1eaft trend k\u1ecbp th\u1eddi gi\u00fap video d\u1ec5 v\u00e0o \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng l\u01b0\u1ee3t ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c follow. Tuy nhi\u00ean, h\u00e3y bi\u1ebfn trend th\u00e0nh ch\u1ea5t ri\u00eang b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 kh\u00e9o l\u00e9o. \u0110\u1eebng qu\u00ean ch\u00e8n CTA k\u00eau g\u1ecdi h\u00e0nh \u0111\u1ed9ng h\u1ee3p l\u00fd \u0111\u1ec3 ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 xem m\u00e0 c\u00f2n t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c ho\u1eb7c mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-TnZwd5cVdoxKbFxpwd6lBehGg7e\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>2. T\u1ed1i \u01b0u h\u00f3a n\u1ed9i dung v\u00e0 th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u0103ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AzNwdv5XyoKfQkxtFQsl9UkLgGf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc c\u00f3 \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1edbn \u0111\u1ebfn l\u01b0\u1ee3ng hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb tr\u00ean TikTok. N\u1ed9i dung c\u1ea7n ng\u1eafn g\u1ecdn, \u0111i th\u1eb3ng v\u00e0o v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 ngay t\u1eeb nh\u1eefng gi\u00e2y \u0111\u1ea7u ti\u00ean \u0111\u1ec3 gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem. H\u00e3y \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o n\u1ed9i dung b\u1ea1n t\u1ea1o ra gi\u1ea3i quy\u1ebft \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhu c\u1ea7u, v\u1ea5n \u0111\u1ec1 ho\u1eb7c \u0111\u00e1nh v\u00e0o c\u1ea3m x\u00fac c\u1ee7a \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau. B\u00ean c\u1ea1nh \u0111\u00f3, th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m \u0111\u0103ng b\u00e0i c\u0169ng c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 quan tr\u1ecdng. N\u00ean ch\u1ecdn c\u00e1c khung gi\u1edd c\u00f3 nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi online nh\u01b0 11h\u201313h ho\u1eb7c 19h\u201321h30. B\u1ea1n c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 theo d\u00f5i TikTok Analytics \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e1c \u0111\u1ecbnh ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c th\u1eddi gian kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3 c\u1ee7a m\u00ecnh ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng nhi\u1ec1u nh\u1ea5t. M\u1ed9t video hay nh\u01b0ng \u0111\u0103ng sai th\u1eddi \u0111i\u1ec3m c\u0169ng s\u1ebd kh\u00f4ng ph\u00e1t huy h\u1ebft hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-PxX1dXZSeoF3qJxUSxgl42FSgtb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>3. T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c, tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-GZ0idpRVOoLH94xHEjjlQmdogkL\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">T\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c v\u1edbi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem l\u00e0 c\u00e1ch hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed9 uy t\u00edn, gi\u1eef ch\u00e2n ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo d\u00f5i v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t. Khi ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea1i b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn, h\u00e3y tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi nhanh ch\u00f3ng v\u00e0 th\u00e2n thi\u1ec7n. \u0110i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 gi\u00fap x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng m\u1ed1i quan h\u1ec7 v\u1edbi kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n t\u0103ng t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 hi\u1ec3n th\u1ecb video tr\u00ean b\u1ea3ng tin. Ngo\u00e0i vi\u1ec7c ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i b\u1eb1ng v\u0103n b\u1ea3n, b\u1ea1n c\u0169ng c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 d\u00f9ng t\u00ednh n\u0103ng \u201ctr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u1eb1ng video\u201d \u0111\u1ec3 t\u1ea1o th\u00eam n\u1ed9i dung xoay quanh c\u00e2u h\u1ecfi c\u1ee7a ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u2013 \u0111i\u1ec1u n\u00e0y gi\u00fap k\u00eanh v\u1eeba c\u00f3 th\u00eam n\u1ed9i dung, v\u1eeba th\u1ec3 hi\u1ec7n s\u1ef1 chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p. TikTok \u0111\u00e1nh gi\u00e1 cao c\u00e1c t\u00e0i kho\u1ea3n c\u00f3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c t\u1ed1t, n\u00ean vi\u1ec7c ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean s\u1ebd gi\u00fap video c\u1ee7a b\u1ea1n d\u1ec5 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u1ea9y l\u00ean xu h\u01b0\u1edbng h\u01a1n.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-Ox3kdJ9sboJL6nxseW7lyxcsgid\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>4. \u0110\u0103ng n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n v\u00e0 \u0111a d\u1ea1ng<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-SxSJd37VYo3bKwxfUXflmFltg5f\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u0110\u1ec3 duy tr\u00ec l\u01b0\u1ee3ng ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem \u1ed5n \u0111\u1ecbnh v\u00e0 t\u0103ng follow l\u00e2u d\u00e0i, vi\u1ec7c \u0111\u0103ng n\u1ed9i dung \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n l\u00e0 \u0111i\u1ec1u kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 b\u1ecf qua. Theo th\u1ed1ng k\u00ea t\u1eeb Influencer Marketing Hub, nh\u1eefng k\u00eanh TikTok \u0111\u0103ng \u00edt nh\u1ea5t 1 video\/ng\u00e0y c\u00f3 t\u1ef7 l\u1ec7 t\u0103ng tr\u01b0\u1edfng follow cao h\u01a1n 68% so v\u1edbi c\u00e1c k\u00eanh \u0111\u0103ng kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u1ec1u. TikTok c\u0169ng x\u00e1c nh\u1eadn r\u1eb1ng vi\u1ec7c duy tr\u00ec t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t \u0111\u0103ng \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n gi\u00fap thu\u1eadt to\u00e1n \u01b0u ti\u00ean \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t video l\u00ean &#8220;For You Page&#8221; (FYP).<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Wz3YdeMSvo3o1Nx0zoll43DSgmd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3962\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3962\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption alignnone\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3962\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-19.png\" alt=\"L\u1ecbch \u0111\u0103ng TikTok \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-19.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-19-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-19-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-19-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/so-1-Lemonn.-vn-19-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3962\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">L\u1ecbch \u0111\u0103ng TikTok \u0111\u1ec1u \u0111\u1eb7n l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t l\u1ee3i th\u1ebf<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"BAbvdO5oFovP0YxLKwal38MNgQb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-IqoGdrdoYoqH9wxxH1BlO3WVgyg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">K\u00eanh TikTok @gymshark \u0111\u0103ng 1\u20133 video m\u1ed7i ng\u00e0y v\u1edbi n\u1ed9i dung \u0111a d\u1ea1ng nh\u01b0 t\u1eadp luy\u1ec7n, th\u1eed th\u00e1ch, review s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m v\u00e0 truy\u1ec1n c\u1ea3m h\u1ee9ng. Nh\u1edd duy tr\u00ec t\u1ea7n su\u1ea5t \u0111\u1ec1u v\u00e0 n\u1ed9i dung ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng, ch\u1ec9 sau 6 th\u00e1ng, Gymshark t\u0103ng g\u1ea7n 2 tri\u1ec7u follower (t\u1eeb 4 l\u00ean g\u1ea7n 6 tri\u1ec7u). TikTok \u01b0u ti\u00ean \u0111\u1ec1 xu\u1ea5t v\u00ec k\u00eanh ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng li\u00ean t\u1ee5c v\u00e0 c\u00f3 t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c cao.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\" old-record-id-YtnydqzIwo74kBxqO0AlS72RgYZ\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"divider\"><strong>5. T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng th\u1eed th\u00e1ch v\u00e0 hashtag challenge<\/strong><\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XOwyd1KOLo530LxE7RDlFFYLg8d\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Hashtag Challenge l\u00e0 m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch c\u1ef1c k\u1ef3 hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 \u0111\u1ec3 lan t\u1ecfa th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u v\u00e0 t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c tr\u00ean TikTok. Theo <em>TikTok for Business<\/em>, m\u1ed9t chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch Hashtag Challenge c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 thu v\u1ec1 tr\u00ean 8,5 t\u1ef7 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem ch\u1ec9 sau 6 ng\u00e0y n\u1ebfu tri\u1ec3n khai \u0111\u00fang c\u00e1ch.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RFL2dRTv9o9vaWx8ykrlE5JpgBe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t v\u00ed d\u1ee5 n\u1ed5i b\u1eadt l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch #GucciModelChallenge v\u1edbi h\u01a1n 1 tri\u1ec7u video tham gia v\u00e0 g\u1ea7n 10 t\u1ef7 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u, gi\u00fap Gucci ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn gi\u1edbi tr\u1ebb m\u1ed9t c\u00e1ch s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VrLUdwFOEoFtZzxCy4WlHzwcgie\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3960\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3960\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3960\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-1.png\" alt=\"T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng th\u1eed th\u00e1ch v\u00e0 hashtag challenge\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/9-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3960\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">T\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng th\u1eed th\u00e1ch v\u00e0 hashtag challenge<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"BAbvdO5oFovP0YxLKwal38MNgQb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-OaGId4Cgroc7acxtXRwl45CNgke\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Doanh nghi\u1ec7p c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 t\u1eadn d\u1ee5ng tr\u00e0o l\u01b0u b\u1eb1ng c\u00e1ch t\u1ea1o th\u1eed th\u00e1ch ri\u00eang (v\u00ed d\u1ee5: #BunRieuChallenge), ho\u1eb7c d\u00f9ng c\u00e1c hashtag \u0111ang hot nh\u01b0 #TikTokMadeMeBuyIt, #FYP. \u0110\u1ec3 khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng t\u1ea1o n\u1ed9i dung (UGC), h\u00e3y t\u1eb7ng qu\u00e0, voucher, gi\u1ea3m gi\u00e1 cho nh\u1eefng video s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o nh\u1ea5t \u2013 v\u1eeba t\u0103ng t\u01b0\u01a1ng t\u00e1c, v\u1eeba th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh s\u1ed1.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-VvPxdv8Ciouij5xXFZRleVwag5d\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u1ea7m quan tr\u1ecdng c\u1ee7a l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem trong vi\u1ec7c t\u0103ng doanh thu v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/h2>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CNKdd1WcOoMVJfxxGTTl49SDgOd\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0\u1ee3t xem gi\u00fap t\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u, thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y doanh thu. N\u1ed9i dung nhi\u1ec1u l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem d\u1ec5 lan t\u1ecfa, n\u00e2ng cao t\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o d\u1ef1ng uy t\u00edn l\u00e2u d\u00e0i cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u.<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LKnHdrIVzopyPex9QeEl8u46gUg\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Lw98dWos2o8F6exkB0tlGyGJgBc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0\u1ee3t xem cao gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c l\u01b0\u1ee3ng l\u1edbn kh\u00e1n gi\u1ea3, t\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng nh\u1eadn di\u1ec7n tr\u00ean th\u1ecb tr\u01b0\u1eddng c\u1ea1nh tranh. Khi video \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c nhi\u1ec1u ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c bi\u1ebft \u0111\u1ebfn r\u1ed9ng r\u00e3i m\u00e0 c\u00f2n t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u1ea5n t\u01b0\u1ee3ng s\u00e2u s\u1eafc, gi\u00fap kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng d\u1ec5 nh\u1edb v\u00e0 \u01b0u ti\u00ean l\u1ef1a ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5. Vi\u1ec7c xu\u1ea5t hi\u1ec7n th\u01b0\u1eddng xuy\u00ean trong feed ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng c\u00f2n g\u00f3p ph\u1ea7n x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng h\u00ecnh \u1ea3nh uy t\u00edn, chuy\u00ean nghi\u1ec7p, gi\u00fap th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u tr\u1edf th\u00e0nh c\u00e1i t\u00ean quen thu\u1ed9c v\u00e0 \u0111\u00e1ng tin c\u1eady trong t\u00e2m tr\u00ed kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng. \u0110\u00e2y ch\u00ednh l\u00e0 n\u1ec1n t\u1ea3ng quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n l\u00e2u d\u00e0i v\u00e0 b\u1ec1n v\u1eefng.<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LMXbdzrdSooZQyxPLIJlE9M3gQ8\" style=\"text-align: left;\">Thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XScydri0to3PP1xk3FllqFYcgAc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0\u1ee3t xem t\u0103ng \u0111\u1ed3ng ngh\u0129a v\u1edbi vi\u1ec7c nhi\u1ec1u kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ho\u1eb7c d\u1ecbch v\u1ee5. \u0110\u00e2y l\u00e0 b\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111\u1ea7u quan tr\u1ecdng \u0111\u1ec3 k\u00edch th\u00edch nhu c\u1ea7u mua h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o c\u01a1 h\u1ed9i chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i t\u1eeb ng\u01b0\u1eddi xem th\u00e0nh ng\u01b0\u1eddi mua.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-C5EidrXa0ojkrOxJJJwlaOztgEb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo b\u00e1o c\u00e1o c\u1ee7a HubSpot (2023), kho\u1ea3ng 81% ng\u01b0\u1eddi d\u00f9ng cho bi\u1ebft h\u1ecd th\u01b0\u1eddng t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m qua video tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi quy\u1ebft \u0111\u1ecbnh mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\n<figure id=\"attachment_3961\" aria-describedby=\"caption-attachment-3961\" style=\"width: 1200px\" class=\"wp-caption aligncenter\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-full wp-image-3961\" src=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-1.png\" alt=\"Thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng\" width=\"1200\" height=\"628\" srcset=\"https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-1.png 1200w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-1-300x157.png 300w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-1-1024x536.png 1024w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-1-768x402.png 768w, https:\/\/lemondigital.vn\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/11-1-600x314.png 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px\" \/><figcaption id=\"caption-attachment-3961\" class=\"wp-caption-text\">Thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u1ee5c ti\u00eau, ti\u1ec1m n\u0103ng<\/figcaption><\/figure><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div data-page-id=\"BAbvdO5oFovP0YxLKwal38MNgQb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"true\">\n<h3 class=\"heading-3 ace-line old-record-id-LP92dqSL0oxDdcxBo9AlysUmg6d\" style=\"text-align: left;\">T\u1ea1o s\u1ef1 lan to\u1ea3 v\u00e0 T\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng<\/h3>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-KVVCdlVV3otLEBxl12Glc3OJgIe\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">L\u01b0\u1ee3t xem l\u1edbn gi\u00fap n\u1ed9i dung d\u1ec5 d\u00e0ng lan truy\u1ec1n tr\u00ean m\u1ea1ng x\u00e3 h\u1ed9i, m\u1edf r\u1ed9ng ph\u1ea1m vi ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn v\u00e0 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng t\u1ea7m \u1ea3nh h\u01b0\u1edfng cho th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u. T\u1eeb \u0111\u00f3, th\u01b0\u01a1ng hi\u1ec7u kh\u00f4ng ch\u1ec9 thu h\u00fat kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng m\u00e0 c\u00f2n t\u1ea1o \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c c\u1ed9ng \u0111\u1ed3ng trung th\u00e0nh v\u00e0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c kinh doanh l\u00e2u d\u00e0i.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Or4CdTH8boBiacxtHdPlJvM9gCg\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">M\u1ed9t v\u00ed d\u1ee5 kh\u00e1c v\u1ec1 video lan t\u1ecfa tr\u00ean TikTok l\u00e0 chi\u1ebfn d\u1ecbch #FlipTheSwitch. Video b\u1eaft \u0111\u1ea7u b\u1eb1ng th\u1eed th\u00e1ch \u0111\u1ed5i \u0111\u1ed3 nhanh gi\u1eefa hai ng\u01b0\u1eddi theo nh\u1ea1c, t\u1ea1o n\u00ean nh\u1eefng kho\u1ea3nh kh\u1eafc h\u00e0i h\u01b0\u1edbc, s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o. Th\u1eed th\u00e1ch n\u00e0y thu h\u00fat h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u ng\u01b0\u1eddi tham gia, v\u1edbi h\u00e0ng tri\u1ec7u video \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c t\u1ea1o ra v\u00e0 h\u01a1n 4 t\u1ef7 l\u01b0\u1ee3t xem tr\u00ean to\u00e0n c\u1ea7u.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TAsUd0BcAoNoRExz5grl5jSNgRR\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Tham kh\u1ea3o: <a href=\"https:\/\/vt.tiktok.com\/ZShgEs5SW\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/vt.tiktok.com\/ZShgEs5SW\/<\/a><\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WZPIdcp1JoxHCDxY2lblUtZmgcb\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<h2 class=\"heading-2 ace-line old-record-id-PhgodT2cxoCV9uxRDe2lvj2pg3g\" style=\"text-align: left;\">L\u01b0u \u00fd trong qu\u00e1 tr\u00ecnh th\u1ef1c hi\u1ec7n b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean Tiktok Shop.<\/h2>\n<div><strong>Ch\u1ecdn s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p:<\/strong> \u01afu ti\u00ean s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m c\u00f3 nhu c\u1ea7u cao, d\u1ec5 tr\u00ecnh b\u00e0y qua video v\u00e0 ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed1i t\u01b0\u1ee3ng kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng tr\u00ean TikTok.<\/div>\n<div><strong>N\u1ed9i dung s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o, ch\u00e2n th\u1ef1c:<\/strong> T\u1ea1o video gi\u1edbi thi\u1ec7u s\u1ea3n ph\u1ea9m h\u1ea5p d\u1eabn, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, tr\u00e1nh qu\u1ea3ng c\u00e1o qu\u00e1 \u201cs\u1ed1c\u201d g\u00e2y m\u1ea5t l\u00f2ng tin.<\/div>\n<div><strong>Tu\u00e2n th\u1ee7 ch\u00ednh s\u00e1ch TikTok:<\/strong> Kh\u00f4ng \u0111\u0103ng n\u1ed9i dung vi ph\u1ea1m b\u1ea3n quy\u1ec1n, h\u00e0ng gi\u1ea3, h\u00e0ng c\u1ea5m ho\u1eb7c n\u1ed9i dung nh\u1ea1y c\u1ea3m.<\/div>\n<div><strong>T\u1ed1i \u01b0u m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 v\u00e0 hashtag:<\/strong> Vi\u1ebft m\u00f4 t\u1ea3 chi ti\u1ebft, r\u00f5 r\u00e0ng, s\u1eed d\u1ee5ng hashtag ph\u1ed5 bi\u1ebfn \u0111\u1ec3 t\u0103ng kh\u1ea3 n\u0103ng ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn.<\/div>\n<div><strong>Ph\u1ea3n h\u1ed3i nhanh ch\u00f3ng:<\/strong> Tr\u1ea3 l\u1eddi b\u00ecnh lu\u1eadn v\u00e0 tin nh\u1eafn kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng nhanh \u0111\u1ec3 x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng uy t\u00edn v\u00e0 th\u00fac \u0111\u1ea9y mua h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div><strong>Ch\u0103m s\u00f3c \u0111\u01a1n h\u00e0ng v\u00e0 v\u1eadn chuy\u1ec3n:<\/strong> \u0110\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o quy tr\u00ecnh \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i, giao h\u00e0ng \u0111\u00fang h\u1eb9n \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00e2ng cao tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m kh\u00e1ch h\u00e0ng.<\/div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-E4wHd4Mv1oLJiaxSsxhl9YNKgqc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\u00a0<\/div>\n<div class=\"image-uploaded gallery old-record-id-OXfMdnrS4o9wMMxv7E5lX7Uugye\" style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-type=\"image\" data-ace-gallery-json=\"{&quot;items&quot;:[{&quot;uuid&quot;:&quot;4082bdf7-0721-4155-b1bb-70cdaf95e749&quot;,&quot;height&quot;:192,&quot;width&quot;:192,&quot;currHeight&quot;:192,&quot;currWidth&quot;:192,&quot;natrualHeight&quot;:600,&quot;natrualWidth&quot;:600,&quot;pluginName&quot;:&quot;imageUpload&quot;,&quot;scale&quot;:0.32,&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https%3A%2F%2Finternal-api-drive-stream-sg.larksuite.com%2Fspace%2Fapi%2Fbox%2Fstream%2Fdownload%2Fpreview%2FWFeLbJcX9o0b6lx1SXElH573gw6%2F%3Fpreview_type%3D16&quot;,&quot;file_token&quot;:&quot;WFeLbJcX9o0b6lx1SXElH573gw6&quot;,&quot;image_type&quot;:&quot;image\/png&quot;,&quot;size&quot;:51803,&quot;comments&quot;:[]}]}\">